{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Meal-DNA: Smart Meal Planner 是一款以人工智能驅動的廚房助手，適合經常面對滿櫃食材卻想不出菜式的家庭用戶。用家只要輸入或掃描現有材料，系統便會按營養目標、飲食限制與預算，自動編排一週菜單。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>智能食材管理與菜單生成</h2>\n<p>應用可手動輸入或掃描條碼加入食材，並設定到期日，於過期前收到推送提醒。AI 會按卡路里與蛋白質目標、飲食限制及預算，生成一週菜單與逐步烹調指示；「用盡食材」模式能為即將過期的材料單獨生成食譜，另有每週備餐指南自動提供批量烹調步驟。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-204-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-205-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-206-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-207-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Meal-DNA: Smart Meal Planner</li>\n<li>應用類別：Food &amp; Drink</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T13:38:05.462968+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":322,"images":4,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-11T13:26:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T09:44:32.628081+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"be09c926304158afb83df03b151f6a77bc2e60bb9be6644dab0533703376abc1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}